   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Mod8_Description",
   "szText": "{c_important}Stinger{/c} becomes an {c_important}Eagle{/c} Skill that deals Lightning damage. \r\n\r\n{c_important}Stinger{/c} strikes a small area, dealing {c_number}{payload:IMPACT_C}{/c} damage and creating a {c_important}{u}Spirit Storm{/u}{/c} that Sparks enemies for {c_number}{dot:TOOLTIP_LIGHTNING_DOT}{/c} damage. Your other {c_important}{u}Spirit Storms{/u}{/c} also deal {c_number}{payload:IMPACT_C}{/c} damage. ",
